    "en": {
      "trackName": "WordAmazing Brain Workout",
      "description": "A word search you can sink into. WordAmazing pairs the simple joy of finding hidden words with stunning\nunderwater backdrops, smart hints, and a long ladder of difficulty -- a relaxing brain workout you can play at\nyour own pace.\nSwipe across the grid in any of 8 directions to clear your target word list, and earn coins for every bonus word\nyou discover along the way. Five difficulty tiers, from Gentle to Master, scale from a cozy 7x7 grid up to an\n11x11 challenge.\n\nFEATURES:\n- Swipe in 8 directions -- horizontal, vertical, and both diagonals\n- 5 difficulty tiers, from Gentle 7x7 grids to Master 11x11 grids\n- Earn coins for every bonus word you discover (4+ letters)\n- Three smart hint types when you need a nudge -- Reveal, Trace, and Sweep\n- Weekly challenges -- Speed Run, Endurance, and Time Trial\n- Global Game Center leaderboards -- This Week, Friends, and All-Time\n- 11 achievements to unlock as you play\n- Stunning backdrops -- coral reefs, anemone gardens, dewdrop macros, and more\n- American (TWL06) and British (SOWPODS) English dictionaries\n- Play on iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch -- coins sync across devices\n- Scrabble-style scoring rewards bigger words and harder letters\n- No timers on the puzzle. Just words.\n\nFind. Swipe. Win.",
